# Implementation Plan - Enterprise Spend Management Platform

Create the React frontend in `project/frontend` and NestJS backend in `project/backend` according to the provided product scope, design system, and personas.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Commands Execution**: Running `npm install` and initializing scripts require terminal commands. These will require user approval before execution in the terminal.
> - **Docker Setup**: The docker-compose configuration will spin up MongoDB and Redis. This requires Docker and Docker Compose installed and running on the host machine.
> - **AI Integration Keys**: The OpenAI and Firebase integration will require placeholders in the `.env` file. These must be replaced with valid keys by the user for real API functionality.

## Open Questions

- None at the moment. We have full specs for features F-01 through F-22 in the `features/` directory and design tokens from the Stitch project.

